 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0
+
+- Orders take a discount code (`applyCode`): `SPRING10` (10 % off items) or `WELCOME5` (5.00 € off items worth 30.00 € or more). Totals show `discountCents`.
+- Fix: free shipping now counts quantities and starts at exactly 50.00 € of items.
+
 ## 1.4.0
 
 - Orders keep the date they were placed on.
